Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:25.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,A handprint ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.97,0:02:30.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,A single hand damaged the gate of the Celestial Realm so much ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This must have been a very large platform before...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But some kind of fight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,shattered it to this extent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,How powerful was that spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, I need to set up a restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:49.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,as well as a recovery formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I get hurt in the Celestial Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,after coming out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can always come back here to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:59.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect a platform could be this useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:00.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Move aside !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,please leave this platform
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:06.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,and find another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.27,0:03:17.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's... from the Giant Demon Clan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:15.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1601,497)\fad(300,000)}Chi Hu\NGiant Demon Clan's young master\NMiddle stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:30.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Late stage Soul Formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:48.57,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1568,514)\fad(300,000)}Sun Tai\NCorpse Sect Head Elder\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't offend him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:50.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:53.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(342,503)\fad(300,000)}Zhou Yi\NFive Elements Sect disciple\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to find someone with a low cultivation level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:06.43,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1620,471)\fad(300,300}Zhai Ban\NEarly stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Early stage Soul Formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I can't underestimate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,his domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:13.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy will be hard to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:14.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I choose him instead ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,please leave this platform
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,and find another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.19,0:04:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then don't blame me for being rude !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:33.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Thunder Toad !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,seen him somewhere before ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Return Cauldron,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,can be activated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:06.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,at certain locations
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:09.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,and after an incense stick of time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:11.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,it allows you to leave the Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and return to your cultivation planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:28.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.75,0:05:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Celestial Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:31.86,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(222,448)\fad(300,300}Rain Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This one will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:55.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spirit stones ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.07,0:05:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that this whole palace
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is made of spirit stones ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:10.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it was at its prime,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,how grand must this place have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,The celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,is countless times purer than regular spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since the Celestial Realm is shattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,is very scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.55,0:06:29.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of spell
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,could have destroyed this place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened in the Celestial Realm back then ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,511)\fad(300,300}A few days later
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,"Gifted by the fifth Rain Celestial Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to Celestial Scholar Tian Hua..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This celestial palace is so luxurious !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.55,0:06:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must have belonged
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.55,0:06:55.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,to a Celestial King !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:07:00.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,This tablet should have been outside to allow people to read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now it's hidden deep inside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a restriction here !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial spiritual energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,The celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.39,0:07:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be condensed with an Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,into jades
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:34.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be used later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:42.71,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1551,498)\fad(300,000}Hong Wen\NDa Lou Sword Sect\NEarly stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place was discovered 3000 years ago by the Da Lou Sword Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Da Lou Sword Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,will kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:03.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder Toad !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:06.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,When did your sect
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,become the owner of the Celestial Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Da Lou sword
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.59,0:08:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,is one of the top artifacts of the Da Lou Sword Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:21.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivators of the same level
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot withstand its attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:27.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is clearly Early stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,but his Thunder Toad
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,is as strong as a Middle stage Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.35,0:08:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:39.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Realm is shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although the formation of this palace has been mostly destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:44.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's still somewhat operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given enough time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will automatically gather scattered celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:51.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and condense it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the Da Lou Sword Sect discovered this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:56.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,you hid it beneath this tablet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:58.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you come here regularly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,to harvest it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:03.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I... wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am not his match.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a small jade
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:19.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,is equivalent to almost half of Zhao's spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:21.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,if it was all combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only try my best
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,to stall him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will find my Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we will kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will never be able to get out of the Celestial Realm !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:54.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Running away ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:14.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teleportation formations in the Celestial Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sect is a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:30.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You rat...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you know I'm Soul Formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as the Origin Soul lives
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,the body is eternal !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're at the same stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just wait for my Senior Brother to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.11,0:10:44.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a refining bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:47.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,an ancient artifact that can trap people and refine them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:50.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,before your Origin Soul dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,listen to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me go !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:10:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will give you my Soul Blood !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Too late...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once we get his bag of holding,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will be able to use the teleportation formations
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Da Lou Sword Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, you are so smart !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Refining his Origin Soul will take time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,300}This matter cannot be rushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,511)\fad(300,300}A few days later
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.19,0:11:24.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a pity that these thousand-years old trees
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,are all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I could use those trees
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:31.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,for wood carving,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,who knows how powerful it could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:40.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Celestial's cave ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although this cave is empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are many restrictions here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.91,0:11:50.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,that are useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once the 9999th restriction is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Restriction Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be upgraded again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:03.84,Save me,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)\pos(972,292)}Save me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:09.64,Save me,,0,0,0,,{\pos(311,383)\fad(300,000)}Save me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:14.84,Save me,,0,0,0,,{\pos(507,494)}Save me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:10.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,This mountain has existed for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am not the first person to find this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can this place
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,still exist ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:20.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if a Celestial is locked up down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's not something I can deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,511)\fad(300,300}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:40.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many top-quality spirit stones !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're rich now !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You rat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:46.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,accept your fate !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:13:00.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You... were prepared for it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I didn't want to keep this sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't even have had time to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sword has hundreds of restrictions carved on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's somewhat similar to my Restriction Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Da Lou Sword Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:23.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,found 37 fragments of the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each of them has a teleportation formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,By holding this jade
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and using spirit stones, one can activate the formations
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,to travel between them at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade is very important,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,it must not fall into the hands of outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.99,0:13:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't feel any celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So why did they
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.39,0:13:48.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,set up the teleportation formation here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:51.19,Second,,0,0,0,,Hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone's here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:54.83,Second,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:57.79,Second,,0,0,0,,I don't know how many Celestials will come this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:58.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestials ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,They look real
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.95,0:14:03.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I can't feel any Life energy from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think it's some kind of illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Celestial Palace of the past ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ye Jiu,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.40,0:14:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't escape today, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:14:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This year's Celestial fruit is extra sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, Celestial Bi Bo invited me to play a song together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:11.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is that possible ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.71,0:15:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's get drunk !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:13.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cheers !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:16.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sister, one more dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:40.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's as if heaven and earth are in their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can bend it at will
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.39,0:15:44.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,in an infinite number of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:46.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this a celestial spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Realm is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.43,0:15:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,How was it destroyed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who's trespassing in the Celestial Realm !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,A palm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fight back !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.91,0:16:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This palm strike
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,can move mountains and split the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:52.48,Second,,0,0,0,,Little sister !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although this palm is an illusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:16:57.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can still learn from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,One move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.55,0:17:18.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Realm was destroyed in one move !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:49.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:55.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.61,0:17:59.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:03.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}and like many other unseparable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:09.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:16.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:22.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:26.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:30.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:36.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:40.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:44.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:50.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:54.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:58.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:04.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.19,0:19:08.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:12.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.61,0:19:17.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:21.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:25.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:31.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.14,0:19:38.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:45.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:51.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.05,0:19:58.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
